  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse multisectorielle pour les populations affect&#xE9;es par les inondations en R&#xE9;publique du Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to reach refugees and host populations affected by flooding with assistance in terms of health, WASH, protection, food security and shelter/NFI. Through this project, UNHCR will provide lifesaving, multisectoral assistance to 44,000 people in the form of protection services, emergency livelihood activities to ensure access to food, support to health services in collaboration with WHO, emergency shelter assistance and rehabilitation of water and sanitation services. Of the 44,000 people targeted through this project, 14,960 are women and 15,840 are children, and 447 are people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
